MATRIX: Linear scan and binary search on a sorted garage.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE linear WITH row AND target
  BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL length WITH row
  GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN n
    IF CALL at (row, i) IS THE SAME AS target THEN
      CASH OUT i
    PERIOD
    BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT MINUS 1
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE binary WITH row AND target AND lo AND hi
  IF lo IS GREATER THAN hi THEN
    CASH OUT MINUS 1
  PERIOD
  BUGATTI mid EQUALS CALL floor WITH (lo PLUS hi) DIVIDED BY 2
  BUGATTI here EQUALS CALL at (row, mid)
  IF here IS THE SAME AS target THEN
    CASH OUT mid
  PERIOD
  IF here IS GREATER THAN target THEN
    CASH OUT CALL binary (row, target, lo, mid MINUS 1)
  PERIOD
  CASH OUT CALL binary (row, target, mid PLUS 1, hi)
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI row EQUALS [1, 3, 4, 7, 9, 12, 15]
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL linear (row, 9)
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL binary (row, 9, 0, 6)
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL binary (row, 8, 0, 6)

